Cell["\<\
Find the limiting values for Fapproach (higher frequency; flying toward) and \
Frecede (lower frequency; flying away).
(This takes a minute.)\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.960055700726102*^9, 3.96005570986094*^9}, {
