Cell["\<\
check that the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]full simplify\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
expression reduces to the very clean version in D1Forigin:\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.960055700726102*^9, 3.96005570986094*^9}, {
